n":"但……但无论怎样，也不能在修道院里留这么大的隐患……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F7542CCF5B3A3D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:1:2":{"text":"통로를 봉쇄할 인력이 부족해","source_cn":"你们没有足够人力封闭密道","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9581AA8A62040D03","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"통로를 봉쇄할 인력이 부족해","female":"통로를 봉쇄할 인력이 부족해","variant_male_record_index":"69460","variant_female_record_index":"69461","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:修女特里莎":{"text":"수녀 테리사","source":"修女特里莎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:修士费尔德南":{"text":"수도사 페르난","source":"修士费尔德南","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:修士马克西姆":{"text":"수도사 맥심","source":"修士马克西姆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":37,"localized_text_count":36,"speaker_count":4}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13221220.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13221220","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13221220","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1322122001:0":{"text":"설득은 어려울 것 같네요...","source_cn":"看来没办法说通他们……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2977FD69A2658F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1322122002:0":{"text":"일단 돌아가서 캐롤라이나에게 상황을 전해야겠어요.","source_cn":"我们还是先回去跟卡列琳娜说一声吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA0767B8ADF7B644","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13221230.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13221230","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13221230","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322123001:1":{"text":"오셨군요. 수도원의 상황은... 좀 어떤가요?","source_cn":"你们回来了。修道院的情况……还好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x158036F4C2A9F0D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1322123001":{"text":"오셨군요. 수도원의 상황은... 좀 어떤가요?","source_cn":"你们回来了。修道院的情况……还好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x158036F4C2A9F0D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322123002:1":{"text":"알겠어요. 죄송해요. 저를 위해 정말 많은 일을 해주셨네요...","source_cn":"我明白了。很抱歉，让你们为我做了这么多事情……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2D71381609CACF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322123003:1":{"text":"사실은 지금 상황에서 화이트마운틴 사람들이 저희를 완벽하게 믿을 수 없다는 것은 알고 있어요.","source_cn":"其实我知道，依照现在的情形，白山的民众不可能彻底信任我们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D1A37F1225A0AF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322123004:1":{"text":"설령 성당에서 살아있는 시체의 존재를 인정하고, 그들이 한때 영광스러운 전사였다는 사실을 모두가 안다 하더라도 여전히 사람들을 공격한다면 그들의 공포는 사라지지 않을 거예요.","source_cn":"哪怕教会认可活死人的身份，哪怕人人都知道他们曾是光荣的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x847A7A7392EA2853","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322123005:1":{"text":"결국 사람들은 우리를 두려워하고, 멀리하며, 심지어는 성당의 의도를 의심하겠죠.","source_cn":"到最后，人们还是会害怕我们，远离我们，甚至还会质疑教会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05F55D3492BFD7AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1322123006:1":{"text":"저는... 그런 일이 일어나는 건 바라지 않아요.","source_cn":"我……不想让事情变成这样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2121C0D9D0002662","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1322123007:1":{"text":"결국 살아있는 시체가 인간을 공격하지 못하는 방법을 찾아야할 것 같네요...","source_cn":"看来还是得找到让活死人不再攻击人类的方法才行……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2E29977B0B65C8B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1322123008:1":{"text":"맞아요. 이 문제를 오랫동안 고민해 왔어요. 그들을 완전한 안식에 들게 하려면 성당 사람들과 협력해야 할 것 같아요.","source_cn":"是的。这个问题我反复思考了很久，我认为想要让他们彻底安...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B0A805B1BF7F119","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1322123009:1":{"text":"네? 왜죠?","source_cn":"咦？为什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DA8E7BF8077E07E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1322123010:1":{"text":"성스러운 빛은 그레이브본을 정화하는 강력한 힘을 가지고 있어요. 비록 저희와 같은 그레이브본에게는 효과가 미미하지만, 이성을 잃은 “살아있는 시체”에게는 가장 좋은 선택일 거예요.","source_cn":"圣光对亡灵有着很强的净化作用。虽然在我们这样的亡灵身上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4221441E280872BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1322123011:1":{"text":"하지만 수도사와 수녀들은 그레이브본을 전혀 믿지 않아요. 분명히 캐롤라이나와 협력하고 싶지 않아 할 텐데... 에휴, 정말 풀 수 없는 매듭 같은 일이네요!","source_cn":"可是那些修士和修女根本不信任亡灵，肯定不会愿意和卡列琳...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBEF6DBC51D61CC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1322123011":{"text":"하지만 수도사와 수녀들은 그레이브본을 전혀 믿지 않아요. 분명히 캐롤라이나와 협력하고 싶지 않아 할 텐데... 에휴, 정말 풀 수 없는 매듭 같은 일이네요!","source_cn":"可是那些修士和修女根本不信任亡灵，肯定不会愿意和卡列琳娜合作……啊啊啊，糟糕，这简直就是一个打不开的死结嘛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBEF6DBC51D61CC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1322123012:1":{"text":"수도원의 성직자들에게 저의 신실함과 진심을 보여줄 거예요. 하지만... 지금은 때가 아닌 것 같네요.","source_cn":"我会向修道院的圣职者展现出我的虔诚和诚意。但……或许不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x897E4C172BDEA1ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1322123014:1":{"text":"장례식에서 벌어진 일로 수도사와 수녀들은 이미 공포에 휩싸였어요. 지금은 그들에게 이 문제를 말하지 않는 게 좋겠어요. 저도 당분간은 수도원에 가지 않을게요.","source_cn":"葬礼上的意外已经引起了修士和修女的恐慌……现在还是不要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30D81844227A0AE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1322123015:1":{"text":"그동안 가문의 장서를 보면서 살아있는 시체의 문제를 해결할 수 있는 단서를 찾아볼게요.","source_cn":"这段时间我会翻翻家族的藏书，或许能从古籍里找到解决活死...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8280F37F860987BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:0:1":{"text":"다른 방법을 찾아보자","source_cn":"想想别的办法","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBCFDD244422EB2C6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"다른 방법을 찾아보자","female":"다른 방법을 찾아보자","variant_male_record_index":"69472","variant_female_record_index":"69473","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1322123013:1":{"text":"지금이요? 지금은 때가 아닌 것 같아요.","source_cn":"现在就去？恐怕不太合适。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC61E9C2AF6A2257","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:1:2":{"text":"다시 수도원에 가서 대화해 보자","source_cn":"再去修道院和他们聊聊","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x09E7F5EBA7594340","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"다시 수도원에 가서 대화해 보자","female":"다시 수도원에 가서 대화해 보자","variant_male_record_index":"69474","variant_female_record_index":"69475","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:0:1":{"text":"(침묵한다)","source_cn":"（沉默不语）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0F6FA44F823490C7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"(침묵한다)","female":"(침묵한다)","variant_male_record_index":"87523","variant_female_record_index":"87524","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:1:2":{"text":"썩 좋지 않아","source_cn":"不是很好","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8B288A9FFD371B21","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"썩 좋지 않아","female":"썩 좋지 않아","variant_male_record_index":"69470","variant_female_record_index":"69471","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卡列琳娜":{"text":"캐롤라이나","source":"卡列琳娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":22,"localized_text_count":21,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/timeline/quest_story/13221160.json":{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_13221160","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13221160","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1322115001:":{"text":"여신이시여...","source_cn":"女神啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9B1000F3820762C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1322115002:":{"text":"저들에게 영원한 안식을 내려주시고","source_cn":"请赐下永恒的安息","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A2B4FC526464571","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1322115003:":{"text":"여기서 죽은 모든 영혼들에게","source_cn":"让所有逝者的灵魂","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCADD2919254AD538","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1322115004:":{"text":"축복을 내려주소서...","source_cn":"得到祝福与安宁……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED7930FEE3B29DA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322116001:1":{"text":"이상한데, 무슨 소리가... 거기, 거기 누구 있어요?","source_cn":"奇怪，什么声音……谁！谁在那里？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x169F8DB279AF7A2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322116002:1":{"text":"음? 아가씨, 장례식에 참석하러 오신 건가요? 그런데 왜 묘지 뒤에서 나오시는지... 방금 묘지 뒤편을 순찰했을 때 아무도 없었는데요!","source_cn":"咦，这位女士，你是来参加葬礼仪式的吗？为什么会突然从墓...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE099580131DD0877","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322116003:1":{"text":"전...","source_cn":"我……<key:dialog31>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x842BD49F1E0099A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1322116004:1":{"text":"잠깐, 당신의 얼굴 빛이... 살아있는 시체처럼 창백하군요? 다, 당신... 인간이 아니야!","source_cn":"等等……你、你的脸色……苍白得和活死人一样！你——你不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFB57ECA6982AAC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1322116005:1":{"text":"네? 살아있는 시체라고요? 어, 어서 사람들을 해치지 못하게 막아요!","source_cn":"什么，活死人？！快……快拦住她，不要让她伤害这里的人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD91BA7DFFB4521AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1322116006:1":{"text":"경고. 위협 감지!","source_cn":"警告，发现威胁！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5995F2AD780DD859","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1322116007:1":{"text":"즉시 제거한다. 보호한다, 캐롤!","source_cn":"必须清除！保护，小卡莎！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC39A0F780DA8B9F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1322116008:1":{"text":"듀라 여신이시여! 이, 이게 대체 뭐지... 무, 무슨 짓을 하려는 거야!","source_cn":"艾雅啊！这……这是什么东西……你……你们要干什么！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17B4705845241F2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1322116009:1":{"text":"카렌 오빠, 멈춰! 해치면 안 돼!","source_cn":"铐兰哥哥，快住手！不要伤害他们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2598C0ABE18D8C9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1322116010:1":{"text":"악마... 분명 악마의 권속이 분명해... 다들, 어서 도망치세요! 어서!","source_cn":"恶魔……他们肯定是恶魔的眷属！大家快跑、快跑啊！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B8107B616D3B01F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:18:1322117001:":{"text":"악마의 권속이 나타났어요. 도망쳐요!","source_cn":"恶魔眷属来了！快跑啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA12F5891F420E86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:18:1322117002:":{"text":"도망쳐! 악마가 나타났다!","source_cn":"快跑！恶魔出现了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88CC81DFC50FA0AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:18:1322117003:":{"text":"듀라 님이시여, 살려주세요!","source_cn":"艾雅在上，救救我们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A1FF4AEF6028917","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:20:13050313:0":{"text":"카렌이 캐롤라이나를 보호하기 위해 나타났지만, 사람들을 모두 놀래켜 도망치게 만들었다.","source_cn":"铐兰出现保护卡列琳娜，却意外吓跑了所有的民众。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1865D919CA834B66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:21:13050312:0":{"text":"모두가 죽은 자를 위해 기도하던 중, 두 명의 수도사가 기도하러 온 캐롤라이나를 발견했다.","source_cn":"众人正为亡者祈祷时，两位修士发现了前来祈祷的卡列琳娜。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0AC1C15A21BDB07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:修士马克西姆":{"text":"수도사 맥심","source":"修士马克西姆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:修士费尔德南":{"text":"수도사 페르난","source":"修士费尔德南","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:修女特里莎":{"text":"수녀 테리사","source":"修女特里莎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卡列琳娜":{"text":"캐롤라이나","source":"卡列琳娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:铐兰":{"text":"카렌","source":"铐兰","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:参加葬礼的男子":{"text":"장례식에 참석한 남자","source":"参加葬礼的男子","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:参加葬礼的老人":{"text":"장례식에 참석한 노인","source":"参加葬礼的老人","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":28,"localized_text_count":19,"speaker_count":8}}}}